* Anthropic blog: routing flagged-hack gradients into a deletable adapter cut reward hacking to near zero in Qwen3-8B [anthropic alignment interpretability]
* A frontier monitor flagged 7% of distributed multi-agent attacks against 87% when one agent did the same task [agent-security alignment evals] {SL:agents-going-wrong}
