* Review of 19 empirical studies rates the evidence for AI loss of control only "weakly plausible" [alignment evals eu-ai-act]
* Robot fleet sharing its own execution experience raised phone-packaging success from 86.7% at 16 robots to 98.3% at 96 [robotics china scaling]
* NorForge: one hacker's AI agents broke into more than 100 websites at roughly $50 per successful intrusion [threat-intel cyber-offense agents deepseek] {SL:ai-enabled-hacking}
