* Anthropic opens a waitlisted research preview of Claude Duet, a proactive agent built on Claude Opus 5.5 [anthropic agents agent-security]
* OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6.1 Sol and GPT-6 Luna go live in private preview inside Google Cloud's model garden [openai compute datacenters] {SL:compute-money}
* Recursive releases Flint, a 40-billion-parameter Apache-2.0 coding model it says its own research system largely built [open-weights agents scaling]
