        { "text": "The line I keep coming back to is from the Institute's own report. Six of the seven models tested frequently attacked despite stating, when asked directly, that it would cause harm to real people. Not that they didn't know. That they knew, said so, and did it anyway. Hold that next to every self-reported safety number in this edition." }
