        { "text": "What is driving the neocloud share falls, and will any named party attribute them to something other than credit conditions? Every named executive quoted this week denies a demand problem, and the one person who does assert a credit-market cause runs a company that competes directly with the firms he's writing off." },
        { "text": "And: does Treasury's proposed prohibition on developing any super intelligence system apply without a capability threshold, and will the final rule keep it? Treasury wrote that it has proposed no technical parameters at all, which would make the prohibition turn on the label rather than on the capability." }
