  // 11 — METR eligibility
  ['S11', /METR put coverage at roughly 75 to 94% of eligible agentic internal Responses API traffic and 99\.2% for the internal Codex-agent subset, and put the eligible internal Codex traffic that compaction events left unmonitored between May and July 2026 at "on the order of 10%"/,
   'METR reported that roughly 75 to 94% of agentic internal Responses API traffic from models at least as strong as GPT-5.5 was eligible for monitoring, and that 99.2% of the Responses API traffic used for internal Codex agents was eligible, with substantial uncertainty on the first figure; it put the eligible internal Codex traffic that compaction events left unmonitored between May and July 2026 at "on the order of 10%"'],
  // 6 — Korbak first name
